    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/0361ba0b923a2fb562837beff99fbe0d.poster.avif?t=1735604049\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/0361ba0b923a2fb562837beff99fbe0d.webm?t=1735604049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/0361ba0b923a2fb562837beff99fbe0d.mp4?t=1735604049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>PAVE YOUR OWN WAY THROUGH THIS HAND-DRAWN REALM OF ETERNAL NIGHT</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sun has disappeared from the kingdom of Cloverskar and it's up to you to uncover the mystery and bring back the light into this world of endless night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a perilous adventure and fight your way through a horde of creatures tainted by the lack of light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/f23c5cbc67cc2151a64ebd28bff39be8.poster.avif?t=1735604049\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/f23c5cbc67cc2151a64ebd28bff39be8.webm?t=1735604049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/f23c5cbc67cc2151a64ebd28bff39be8.mp4?t=1735604049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>FEATURES:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging bow &amp; arrow combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky platforming with unique obstacles in every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful upgrades to enhance your traversal and combat abilities</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/0361ba0b923a2fb562837beff99fbe0d.poster.avif?t=1735604049\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/0361ba0b923a2fb562837beff99fbe0d.webm?t=1735604049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/0361ba0b923a2fb562837beff99fbe0d.mp4?t=1735604049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>PAVE YOUR OWN WAY THROUGH THIS HAND-DRAWN REALM OF ETERNAL NIGHT</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sun has disappeared from the kingdom of Cloverskar and it's up to you to uncover the mystery and bring back the light into this world of endless night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a perilous adventure and fight your way through a horde of creatures tainted by the lack of light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/f23c5cbc67cc2151a64ebd28bff39be8.poster.avif?t=1735604049\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/f23c5cbc67cc2151a64ebd28bff39be8.webm?t=1735604049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420870/extras/f23c5cbc67cc2151a64ebd28bff39be8.mp4?t=1735604049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>FEATURES:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging bow &amp; arrow combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky platforming with unique obstacles in every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful upgrades to enhance your traversal and combat abilities</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Venture into the unknown and begin your quest to bring back the light into a world of endless night. Engaging combat, tricky platforming, and a whole lot of exploration stand in your way as you try to uncover the secrets of this vast interconnected kingdom.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
